# Small box source placed inside the digimouse phantom, centered at world
# (0,0,0) mm. A 4x4x4 mm box here sits almost entirely in label 12 ("Body"
# tissue), no Air. This is the "real object" you're measuring -- used for the
# RUN_TAG=box campaign, which produces projection data (measured counts).
/gate/source/addSource source1 gps

/gate/source/source1/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/source1/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/source1/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV

/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/type Volume
/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/shape Para
/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/halfx 2. mm
/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/halfy 2. mm
/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/halfz 2. mm
/gate/source/source1/gps/pos/centre 0. 0. 0. mm

/gate/source/source1/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/source1/setActivity 0.0001 Ci

/gate/source/list